      "content": "but even when i try to touch things, it doesn't feel real. it feels like i'm just watching a movie of someone else's life. like if i stopped interacting, if i just stopped being \"online\", would there even be anything left of me? it's like i've become so digital that the physical version of me is just... an empty shell.",
